## 🧪 **TESTING OBBLIGATORIO**

### COVERAGE MINIMO
- Statement: >35%
- Branch: >30%
- Function: >40%
- Lines: >35%

### SCRIPT CONTROLLO QUALITÀ
```bash
npm run pre-modifiche  # BLOCCO se errori - OBBLIGATORIO
npm run post-modifiche # BLOCCO se problemi - OBBLIGATORIO
npm run conta-problemi # DEVE essere = 0 - SEMPRE
```

### TEMPLATE TEST MINIMO
```typescript
describe('MyComponent', () => {
  it('should render with responsive text', () => {
    const { getByText } = render(<MyComponent />);
    expect(getByText('Titolo')).toBeTruthy();
  });
});
```

---

## 🚫 **ANTI-PATTERNS VIETATI**

### ❌ Doppio Scaling
```typescript
<FormattedText fontSize={scaleFont(24)}>Testo</FormattedText>
```

### ❌ Mixing di Sistemi
```typescript
<Text style={{ fontSize: scaleFont(24) }}>Testo 1</Text>
<FormattedText fontSize={24}>Testo 2</FormattedText>
```

### ❌ Platform-Specific Differences
```typescript
{Platform.OS === 'ios' ? 
  <FormattedText fontSize={24}>iOS</FormattedText> : 
  <FormattedText fontSize={26}>Android</FormattedText>
}
```

### ❌ Logica Complessa
```typescript
<FormattedText fontSize={isTablet ? (isLandscape ? 32 : 28) : 24}>
  Testo
</FormattedText>
```

---

## 💡 **TEMPLATE COMPONENTI**

### COMPONENTE STANDARD
```typescript
const NewComponent = ({ title, description }: Props) => (
  <View>
    <FormattedText 
      fontSize={40}
      fontWeight="bold"
      lineBreakStrategyIOS="push-out"
      breakStrategyAndroid="highQuality"
      hyphenationFrequencyAndroid="full"
    >
      {title}
    </FormattedText>
    <FormattedText fontSize={16}>{description}</FormattedText>
  </View>
);
```

### LAYOUT CONTROLLATO (FIXED LINES)
```typescript
const ControlledLayout = ({ text }: Props) => (
  <FormattedText 
    fontSize={24} 
    fixed={true} 
    fixedLines={2}
    lineBreakStrategyIOS="push-out"
    breakStrategyAndroid="highQuality"
    hyphenationFrequencyAndroid="full"
  >
    {text}
  </FormattedText>
);
```

### COMPONENTI CRITICI (TITOLI PRINCIPALI)
```typescript
const CriticalTitle = ({ title }: Props) => (
  <SafeFormattedText 
    fontSize={75} 
    fixed={true} 
    fixedLines={2}
    enableFallbackFontChain={true}
    lineBreakStrategyIOS="push-out"
    breakStrategyAndroid="highQuality"
    hyphenationFrequencyAndroid="full"
  >
    {title}
  </SafeFormattedText>
);
```

